  <div class="mk-panel-header"><div class="mk-panel-title">发放规则配置</div></div>
  <div><div class="pt-6 space-y-4">
          <!-- 规则卡片1 -->
          <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-blue-300 transition-colors">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
              <h4 class="text-sm text-slate-800">科技型小微开户送红包活动 - 发放规则</h4>
              <span class="text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 font-semibold">生效中</span>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 text-[11px]">
              <div><span class="text-slate-400 block">触发条件</span><span class="font-semibold text-slate-700">对公开户成功</span></div>
              <div><span class="text-slate-400 block">发放权益</span><span class="font-semibold text-slate-700">微信50元代金券</span></div>
              <div><span class="text-slate-400 block">每人限领</span><span class="font-semibold text-slate-700">1次/活动周期</span></div>
              <div><span class="text-slate-400 block">日发放上限</span><span class="font-semibold text-slate-700">500张/天</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-3 p-2.5 bg-amber-50 rounded border border-amber-200 text-[10px] text-amber-700"><strong>风控规则：</strong>同一企业IP限3人/天，单设备限1次，黑名单企业自动拦截</div>
          </div>

          <!-- 规则卡片2 -->
          <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-blue-300 transition-colors">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
              <h4 class="text-sm text-slate-800">年中代发薪专项权益活动 - 发放规则</h4>
              <span class="text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-slate-100 text-slate-500 font-semibold">已结束</span>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 text-[11px]">
              <div><span class="text-slate-400 block">触发条件</span><span class="font-semibold text-slate-700">代发薪签约完成</span></div>
              <div><span class="text-slate-400 block">发放权益</span><span class="font-semibold text-slate-700">星巴克30元券 + 年费减免券</span></div>
              <div><span class="text-slate-400 block">每人限领</span><span class="font-semibold text-slate-700">各1次</span></div>
              <div><span class="text-slate-400 block">日发放上限</span><span class="font-semibold text-slate-700">1000张/天</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-3 p-2.5 bg-blue-50 rounded border border-blue-200 text-[10px] text-blue-700"><strong>特殊规则：</strong>代发金额&ge;50万员工可额外领取高端实物权益（拉杆箱）</div>
          </div>

