            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 text-[11px]">
              <div><span class="text-slate-400 block">触发条件</span><span class="font-semibold text-slate-700">完成任意一笔交易</span></div>
              <div><span class="text-slate-400 block">发放方式</span><span class="font-semibold text-slate-700">抽奖（概率分配）</span></div>
              <div><span class="text-slate-400 block">每人限领</span><span class="font-semibold text-slate-700">3次/天</span></div>
              <div><span class="text-slate-400 block">奖品池总量</span><span class="font-semibold text-slate-700">500份</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-4 gap-2 text-[10px]">
              <div class="p-2 bg-yellow-50 rounded text-center"><span class="block font-bold text-yellow-700">一等奖</span><span class="text-slate-500">拉杆箱 x5</span></div>
